<title>HONG KONG: Philippines SM International sets US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Philippines SM International sets US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by bookrunner and joint lead manager Merrill Lynch Far East.</p>
<p>BORROWER SM INTERNATIONAL LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR SM INVESTMENTS CORP</p>
<p> AMT	US$100 MLN COUPON     6ML+100 BP  MATURITY  14.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	  ISS PRICE  PAR	   RE-OFFER    --</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	 CALLS	NONE	  PAY DATE  14.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG REPAYMENT  BULLET	DENOMS(K) US$100/300</p>
<p>RATINGS  NONE</p>
<p>SALES LIMITS UK/HK/SINGAPORE/CAYMAN ISLANDS/PHILIPPINES/</p>
<p>		  US (CATEGORY 2, REG S, TEFRA D)</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	  CRS DEF    YES	   FORCE MAJ IPMA2</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH    HOME CTRY  PHILIPPINES TAX PROV   *</p>
<p> FEES     30 BP FLAT MGT,UND    NA	    SELLING   NA</p>
<p> LEADS    MERRILL LYNCH FAR EAST (BOOKS), LTCB ASIA</p>
<p> NOTES    *WHERE WITHHOLDING TAX IS IMPOSED THE TERMS AND</p>
<p>	    CONDITIONS SHALL FOLLOW IPMA RECOMMENDATIONS.</p>
<p>	    SM INVESTMENTS CORP IS THE PARENT COMPANY OF</p>
<p>	    SM PRIME.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
</text>
